{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical/items/214395/", "pk": 214395, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical/", "pk": 30, "shortname": "hawaiinautical", "name": "Hawaii Nautical - Oahu", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Waikiki Turtle Snorkel Sail", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": true, "color": 9, "unicode": "Waikiki Turtle Snorkel Sail", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": -900, "description": "#Beautiful sail to start your day!\n\n##Schedule\nDaily, April - November\n- 8am - 10am\n- 2:30pm - 4:30pm\n\n##About\nThrilling snorkeling experiences including seeing Hawaiian green sea turtles.  \n\nBring your snorkel and mask, or sanitized re-usable sets are available as a backup. Fins and snorkel vests are provide and in-water assistance from expert crew are included.\n\n*FREE TURTLE RERIDE TERMS:* Return trip is of equal or lesser value. Rerides only, no refunds. Reride is for 1 return trip per 1 original paid trip.  ​\n\n##Departure - Near Waikiki\nKewalo Basin Harbor\n1125 Ala Moana Blvd\nHonolulu, HI 96814\n\nOptional Shuttle available from limited Waikiki pick up location and at an additional fee.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#Aloha!\n#IMPORTANT REQUIRED STEP:  Separately you will receive an email for the waiver to be done by each individual in your party participating in a Hawaii Nautical/Port Waikiki Cruises activity. Parents/guardians also submit a form for each person 17 and under. Answer all questions, review health and safety precautions, and sign the waiver acknowledgment within one day of your scheduled activity.\n\nPlease bring a towel, wear swimwear and easy to remove footwear for the barefoot vessel.  For safety, no spray sunscreen to be used on board and no full face masks may be used for snorkeling.\n\n*FREE TURTLE RERIDE TERMS: *Return trip is of equal or lesser value. Rerides only, no refunds. Reride is for 1 return trip per 1 original paid trip.  ​\n\nConvenient metered self-parking is available at the harbor and nearby beach park.  Please plan extra time for parking on Saturdays from 8-12pm due to the Saturday Farmer's Market.\n\nThank you for your reservation with Hawaii Nautical. We look forward to having you with us!\n\nMahalo!\n\nHawaii Nautical \nPH: 808-234-7245", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "##Check in at the vessel \"HONU LANI\" along the front row of slips at the \"HAWAII NAUTICAL\" yellow sign at **Slip F28** no later than 20 minutes prior to departure.\n\nConvenient self-parking is available at the harbor and nearby beach park.  Please plan extra time for parking on Saturdays from 8-12pm due to the Saturday Farmer's Market.\n\nIf self-driving, some GPS units locate better using \"1079 Ala Moana Boulevard, Honolulu, HI 96814\"\n\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ZF1mUatGRPyzF0cHBKPs)", "no_transportation_minutes": 20, "headline": "April - November • Daily • 2 Hrs • Turtle Sightings Guaranteed!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinauti